OL,3,GNEWSAEight men charged in cockfighting
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe men appeared at Bradford
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on Friday. The
OL,8,Fhearing was adjourned and the men are
OL,9,Fnext due to appear at Bradford Crown
OL,10,FCourt on 23 October.
